       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-BICARTESIAN-MONAD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BICARTESIAN-PROOFS.
           05  WS-BICARTESIAN-CLOSED-ADJ   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ORDERED-MONAD-BIND-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COEQUALIZER-CONFLUENCE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TENSOR-DISTRIBUTIVE-LATT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BICARTESIAN-MONAD-SEAL   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-BICARTESIAN-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-BICARTESIAN-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-BICARTESIAN-CODE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ADJUNCTION-AND-MONAD.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-COEQUALIZER-AND-LATTICE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-BICARTESIAN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-ADJUNCTION-AND-MONAD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BICARTESIAN-CLOSED-ADJ.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ORDERED-MONAD-BIND-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-COEQUALIZER-AND-LATTICE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COEQUALIZER-CONFLUENCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TENSOR-DISTRIBUTIVE-LATT.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-BICARTESIAN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-BICARTESIAN-CLOSED-ADJ = 1 AND
              WS-ORDERED-MONAD-BIND-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COEQUALIZER-CONFLUENCE = 1 AND
              WS-TENSOR-DISTRIBUTIVE-LATT = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-BICARTESIAN-MONAD-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-BICARTESIAN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-BICARTESIAN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-BICARTESIAN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-BICARTESIAN-CODE.
